WEBVTT

1
00:00:28.583 --> 00:00:33.750
In verse 14.11, Lord Krishna says that

2
00:00:33.750 --> 00:00:36.500
when sattva Guna increases,

3
00:00:36.500 --> 00:00:39.500
its signs become clearly visible.

4
00:00:39.500 --> 00:00:41.958
In the earlier verses of this chapter

5
00:00:41.958 --> 00:00:45.625
He had explained that the three gunas

6
00:00:45.625 --> 00:00:48.875
constantly try to dominate one another.

7
00:00:48.875 --> 00:00:50.458
Now He describes

8
00:00:50.458 --> 00:00:52.375
how the signs of sattva Guna

9
00:00:52.375 --> 00:00:56.083
can be recognised when it rises.

10
00:00:56.083 --> 00:00:58.833
Lord Krishna makes clear –

11
00:00:58.833 --> 00:01:00.958
when sattva Guna becomes dominant,

12
00:01:00.958 --> 00:01:04.375
all the gateways of the body become illuminated.

13
00:01:04.375 --> 00:01:05.666
This develops clarity,

14
00:01:05.666 --> 00:01:06.333
discernment,

15
00:01:06.333 --> 00:01:09.041
and the ability to see things

16
00:01:09.041 --> 00:01:11.208
as they truly are.

17
00:01:16.083 --> 00:01:19.416
In this verse, Lord Krishna compares the body

18
00:01:19.416 --> 00:01:22.416
to a city with nine gateways –

19
00:01:22.416 --> 00:01:26.291
the eyes, ears, nostrils, mouth,

20
00:01:26.291 --> 00:01:29.500
the organ of reproduction, and
the organ of elimination.

21
00:01:29.500 --> 00:01:30.458
Through these gateways,

22
00:01:30.458 --> 00:01:34.000
consciousness connects with the outer world.

23
00:01:34.000 --> 00:01:35.708
When sattva Guna increases,

24
00:01:35.708 --> 00:01:38.083
these gateways become illuminated.

25
00:01:38.083 --> 00:01:39.333
This means

26
00:01:39.333 --> 00:01:41.916
the senses begin to function with clarity

27
00:01:41.916 --> 00:01:43.708
and discernment.

28
00:01:43.708 --> 00:01:45.083
Just as lighting a lamp

29
00:01:45.083 --> 00:01:47.000
brightens a room,

30
00:01:47.000 --> 00:01:49.250
the growth of sattva Guna

31
00:01:49.250 --> 00:01:52.666
makes the body an instrument for
gaining knowledge.

32
00:01:52.666 --> 00:01:54.250
In such a state, a person

33
00:01:54.250 --> 00:01:57.250
sees things as they truly are.

34
00:01:57.250 --> 00:01:58.541
For example –

35
00:01:58.541 --> 00:01:59.833
when the ear

36
00:01:59.833 --> 00:02:01.875
is illuminated by sattva Guna,

37
00:02:01.875 --> 00:02:04.916
a person recognises meaningful words

38
00:02:04.916 --> 00:02:08.250
and leaves aside meaningless noise.

39
00:02:08.250 --> 00:02:10.166
Similarly, when sattva’s influence

40
00:02:10.166 --> 00:02:12.125
is on the tongue,

41
00:02:12.125 --> 00:02:13.416
it chooses nourishing

42
00:02:13.416 --> 00:02:14.500
food for the body

43
00:02:14.500 --> 00:02:18.041
rather than chasing momentary taste.

44
00:02:18.041 --> 00:02:21.041
This light does not only give
intellectual knowledge,

45
00:02:21.041 --> 00:02:24.458
but provides deep discernment

46
00:02:24.458 --> 00:02:28.625
that guides conduct and decisions.

47
00:02:28.625 --> 00:02:30.708
A person under sattva Guna

48
00:02:30.708 --> 00:02:33.291
sees beyond immediate gain

49
00:02:33.291 --> 00:02:34.416
and reflects on

50
00:02:34.416 --> 00:02:36.500
the consequences of their actions.

51
00:02:36.500 --> 00:02:39.916
Therefore, the growth of sattva Guna
brings clarity,

52
00:02:39.916 --> 00:02:43.333
knowledge, and inner contentment,

53
00:02:43.333 --> 00:02:46.458
which gradually leads a person

54
00:02:46.458 --> 00:02:48.416
toward spiritual progress.

55
00:02:53.125 --> 00:02:55.583
The senses of human –

56
00:02:55.583 --> 00:02:57.583
eyes, ears,

57
00:02:57.583 --> 00:03:00.291
tongue, nose, and skin –

58
00:03:00.291 --> 00:03:04.791
were not given to you only for indulgence.

59
00:03:04.791 --> 00:03:05.750
They were given

60
00:03:05.750 --> 00:03:09.875
to be used rightly.

61
00:03:09.875 --> 00:03:11.291
But when the mind is disturbed

62
00:03:11.291 --> 00:03:14.125
by desires or laziness,

63
00:03:14.125 --> 00:03:18.000
the senses also become confused.

64
00:03:18.000 --> 00:03:21.541
Then you begin absorbing things

65
00:03:21.541 --> 00:03:25.208
that steal your peace –

66
00:03:25.208 --> 00:03:28.333
watching meaningless content,

67
00:03:28.333 --> 00:03:31.833
staring at a screen endlessly,

68
00:03:31.833 --> 00:03:35.625
listening to gossip, or chasing taste.

69
00:03:35.625 --> 00:03:39.000
When sattva Guna grows within you,

70
00:03:39.000 --> 00:03:41.541
everything begins to change.

71
00:03:41.541 --> 00:03:45.125
You start making conscious choices –

72
00:03:45.125 --> 00:03:47.666
what to watch, what to hear,

73
00:03:47.666 --> 00:03:48.791
what to eat,

74
00:03:48.791 --> 00:03:53.166
and which conversations to join.

75
00:03:53.166 --> 00:03:55.833
This is viveka – discernment –

76
00:03:55.833 --> 00:04:01.875
when you decide what enters your heart

77
00:04:01.875 --> 00:04:03.541
through your senses.

78
00:04:03.541 --> 00:04:07.625
Just as cleaning a window glass

79
00:04:07.625 --> 00:04:10.250
lets sunlight pour in,

80
00:04:10.250 --> 00:04:14.333
in the same way - sattva purifies the senses

81
00:04:14.333 --> 00:04:18.458
and life begins to look clear.

82
00:04:18.458 --> 00:04:23.500
This is where inner peace begins.

83
00:04:23.500 --> 00:04:27.083
Not from running away from the world,

84
00:04:27.083 --> 00:04:28.750
but from living with awareness

85
00:04:28.750 --> 00:04:31.333
of the senses.

86
00:04:31.333 --> 00:04:35.500
Start with one sense today.

87
00:04:35.500 --> 00:04:39.375
For example – reduce unnecessary screen time,

88
00:04:39.375 --> 00:04:44.750
or choose good reading material.

89
00:04:44.750 --> 00:04:47.500
You will discover for yourself

90
00:04:47.500 --> 00:04:49.916
how this small change

91
00:04:49.916 --> 00:04:52.916
positively transforms

92
00:04:52.916 --> 00:04:57.333
your inner world.

93
00:05:02.083 --> 00:05:04.291
Do you know –

94
00:05:04.291 --> 00:05:09.041
a family’s peace does not depend only

95
00:05:09.041 --> 00:05:12.750
on big decisions or financial security?

96
00:05:12.750 --> 00:05:16.666
It often also depends on

97
00:05:16.666 --> 00:05:18.875
how family members

98
00:05:18.875 --> 00:05:22.666
use their senses.

99
00:05:22.666 --> 00:05:27.000
When the television blares all day at home,

100
00:05:27.000 --> 00:05:31.958
or everyone has their phone at the dinner table,

101
00:05:31.958 --> 00:05:36.750
or everyone is constantly entangled in
multiple things –

102
00:05:36.750 --> 00:05:41.583
restlessness slowly begins to grow.

103
00:05:41.583 --> 00:05:44.333
Conversations become sharp,

104
00:05:44.333 --> 00:05:46.333
attention scatters,

105
00:05:46.333 --> 00:05:49.208
and connection weakens.

106
00:05:49.208 --> 00:05:53.583
Think about this – your child comes
home from school

107
00:05:53.583 --> 00:05:58.000
and wants to excitedly share an achievement.

108
00:05:58.000 --> 00:06:00.833
But if you are glued to a screen

109
00:06:00.833 --> 00:06:04.583
and respond with only a vague ‘hmm’ –

110
00:06:04.583 --> 00:06:07.875
how disappointed their heart will be.

111
00:06:07.875 --> 00:06:13.125
But if you listen attentively and with joy,

112
00:06:13.125 --> 00:06:16.000
not only will their enthusiasm grow –

113
00:06:16.000 --> 00:06:18.875
but their confidence will grow

114
00:06:18.875 --> 00:06:22.000
and their personality will develop fully too.

115
00:06:22.000 --> 00:06:26.041
When sattva Guna grows, even these small

116
00:06:26.041 --> 00:06:29.250
things change.

117
00:06:29.250 --> 00:06:32.416
Meals are shared together in peace

118
00:06:32.416 --> 00:06:36.375
or in a light and joyful atmosphere.

119
00:06:36.375 --> 00:06:40.166
Words are chosen thoughtfully.

120
00:06:40.166 --> 00:06:41.291
Screens

121
00:06:41.291 --> 00:06:45.750
are set aside for a while,

122
00:06:45.750 --> 00:06:47.208
and people

123
00:06:47.208 --> 00:06:51.291
truly begin to listen to each other.

124
00:06:51.291 --> 00:06:54.750
This is the effect of sattva.

125
00:06:54.750 --> 00:06:58.708
No big change is needed for this –

126
00:06:58.708 --> 00:07:03.375
only awareness – of what you watch,

127
00:07:03.375 --> 00:07:05.666
what you say, what you hear,

128
00:07:05.666 --> 00:07:08.958
and what you do.

129
00:07:08.958 --> 00:07:12.125
You can build a home

130
00:07:12.125 --> 00:07:15.666
where the atmosphere is light, respectful,

131
00:07:15.666 --> 00:07:18.791
and joyful.

132
00:07:18.791 --> 00:07:21.000
Start small –

133
00:07:21.000 --> 00:07:25.041
spend one hour a day

134
00:07:25.041 --> 00:07:29.250
without screens, or even when tired,

135
00:07:29.250 --> 00:07:32.041
use gentle words.

136
00:07:32.041 --> 00:07:34.458
When the senses are pure,

137
00:07:34.458 --> 00:07:37.625
love flows naturally –

138
00:07:37.625 --> 00:07:40.875
and relationships deepen.

139
00:07:45.500 --> 00:07:50.166
The mind sits behind many gateways –

140
00:07:50.166 --> 00:07:52.500
the eyes, ears,

141
00:07:52.500 --> 00:07:56.041
tongue, and other senses.

142
00:07:56.041 --> 00:07:56.708
Through these

143
00:07:56.708 --> 00:08:01.166
it receives experience and energy.

144
00:08:01.166 --> 00:08:08.500
But if these gateways remain open without
any discipline,

145
00:08:08.500 --> 00:08:11.708
how will the mind stay focused?

146
00:08:11.708 --> 00:08:12.958
At the workplace

147
00:08:12.958 --> 00:08:16.500
you sit down to do something important.

148
00:08:16.500 --> 00:08:20.083
But if the senses are already filled with noise,

149
00:08:20.083 --> 00:08:22.125
endless notifications,

150
00:08:22.125 --> 00:08:26.000
and unnecessary conversations –

151
00:08:26.000 --> 00:08:29.750
how will the mind find peace and clarity?

152
00:08:29.750 --> 00:08:33.083
Sattva cleanses these gateways.

153
00:08:33.083 --> 00:08:35.208
It brings calm to the senses

154
00:08:35.208 --> 00:08:38.166
and helps the mind concentrate.

155
00:08:38.166 --> 00:08:41.625
When you live and work in sattva,

156
00:08:41.625 --> 00:08:44.166
your conversations are mindful,

157
00:08:44.166 --> 00:08:46.583
your meetings are meaningful,

158
00:08:46.583 --> 00:08:48.041
and your results

159
00:08:48.041 --> 00:08:50.250
are of high quality.

160
00:08:50.250 --> 00:08:52.416
You do not react on impulse –

161
00:08:52.416 --> 00:08:55.791
you respond with clarity.

162
00:08:55.791 --> 00:08:59.916
If you truly wish to be productive,

163
00:08:59.916 --> 00:09:03.875
begin by paying attention

164
00:09:03.875 --> 00:09:04.958
to how you are

165
00:09:04.958 --> 00:09:09.041
using your senses.

166
00:09:09.041 --> 00:09:11.166
Choose carefully what

167
00:09:11.166 --> 00:09:13.958
your eyes and ears take in.

168
00:09:13.958 --> 00:09:16.583
Choose it carefully.

169
00:09:16.583 --> 00:09:19.791
Begin the day with stillness.

170
00:09:19.791 --> 00:09:22.208
Reduce unnecessary noise

171
00:09:22.208 --> 00:09:27.000
and protect the space of your mindset.

172
00:09:27.000 --> 00:09:29.541
This is sattva at work –

173
00:09:29.541 --> 00:09:30.500
it quietly

174
00:09:30.500 --> 00:09:34.625
elevates the quality of your work, your presence,

175
00:09:34.625 --> 00:09:38.500
and your leadership.
